<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .form-group {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .inline-fields {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .input-field {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    min-width: 150px;
  }
  .full-width-input {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: unset;
  }
  .section-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin: 0;">UNIVERSITY OF GUAM</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12px; margin: 0;">UNIBETSEDÁT GUÁHAN</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold; margin: 0;">OFFICE OF THE SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND PROVOST</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">REQUEST FOR COURSE REPLACEMENT</h2>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>Course to be Replaced:</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="course_to_be_replaced_title">{{ course_to_be_replaced_title }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>1. Title of Course to be Replaced:</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="replaced_course_title">{{ replaced_course_title }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>2. Catalog Number of Course to be Replaced:</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="replaced_course_catalog_number">{{ replaced_course_catalog_number }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>3. Is this course cross-listed with another department?</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="radio" name="cross_listed_yes" value="yes"> Yes</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="cross_listed_no" value="no"> No</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>If Yes, list the cross-listed catalog number(s):</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="cross_listed_catalog_numbers">{{ cross_listed_catalog_numbers }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>4. Level of Instruction:</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="level_undergraduate" value="undergraduate"> Undergraduate</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="level_graduate" value="graduate"> Graduate</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="level_both" value="both"> Both</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>5. Credit Hours:</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="replaced_credit_hours_400_500">{{ replaced_credit_hours_400_500 }}</span></div>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="replaced_credit_hours_400_g">{{ replaced_credit_hours_400_g }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>6. What session(s) is this course offered?</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="session_fall" value="fall"> Fall</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="session_spring" value="spring"> Spring</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="session_summer" value="summer"> Summer</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="session_intersession" value="intersession"> Intersession</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>7. What is the yearly cycle for this course?</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="cycle_all_years" value="all_years"> All Years</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="cycle_even_years" value="even_years"> Even Years</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="cycle_odd_years" value="odd_years"> Odd Years</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="cycle_one_term_only" value="one_term_only"> One (1) Term Only</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">New Course</h3>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>8. Title of New Course:</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="new_course_title">{{ new_course_title }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>9. Catalog Number of New Course:</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="new_course_catalog_number">{{ new_course_catalog_number }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>10. Level of Instruction:</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_level_undergraduate" value="undergraduate"> Undergraduate</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_level_graduate" value="graduate"> Graduate</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_level_both" value="both"> Both (/G)</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>11. Credit Hours:</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="new_course_credit_hours">{{ new_course_credit_hours }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>12. Is this course cross-listed with another department?</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_cross_listed_yes" value="yes"> Yes</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_cross_listed_no" value="no"> No</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>If Yes, list the cross-listed catalog number(s):</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="new_cross_listed_catalog_numbers">{{ new_cross_listed_catalog_numbers }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>13. What session(s) is this course offered?</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_session_fall" value="fall"> Fall</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_session_spring" value="spring"> Spring</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_session_summer" value="summer"> Summer</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_session_intersession" value="intersession"> Intersession</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>14. What is the yearly cycle for this course?</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_cycle_all_years" value="all_years"> All Years</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_cycle_even_years" value="even_years"> Even Years</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_cycle_odd_years" value="odd_years"> Odd Years</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="new_cycle_one_term_only" value="one_term_only"> One (1) Term Only</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>15. First term and year for this course:</p>
    <div class="inline-fields">
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="new_course_first_term_year">{{ new_course_first_term_year }}</span></div>
      <p style="margin: 0;">Length of Instruction (Weeks):</p>
      <div class="input-field"><span data-field="new_course_length_weeks">{{ new_course_length_weeks }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>16. Prerequisites:</p>
    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p>A. Instructor / Advisor consent required?</p>
      <div class="inline-fields">
        <label><input type="radio" name="prereq_consent_yes" value="yes"> Yes</label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="prereq_consent_no" value="no"> No</label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>B. Prerequisites Catalog #</p>
      <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <span data-field="prerequisite_catalog_number">{{ prerequisite_catalog_number }}</span>
      </div>
      <p>Prerequisite Course Title</p>
      <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <span data-field="prerequisite_course_title">{{ prerequisite_course_title }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 15px;">
      <p>C. Additional Prerequisites:</p>
      <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
        <span data-field="additional_prerequisites">{{ additional_prerequisites }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>17. Proposed Effective Date (Term and Year):</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="proposed_effective_date">{{ proposed_effective_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>18. DESCRIBE LIBRARY AND INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY RESOURCES AVAILABLE TO SUPPORT COURSE: If insufficient library sources are available, describe alternatives that will be used.</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="height: 100px; margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="library_it_resources_description">{{ library_it_resources_description }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>19. IN WHAT WAY IS THIS COURSE PREFERABLE TO THE COURSE BEING REPLACED?</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="height: 100px; margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="course_preference_justification">{{ course_preference_justification }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>20. WHAT IS THE ANTICIPATED CLASS SIZE AND DOCUMENT INDICATIONS ON HOW THE NEW COURSE WILL MEET ITS PROJECTED SIZE?</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="height: 100px; margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="anticipated_class_size_projection">{{ anticipated_class_size_projection }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>21. STATE HOW THE NEW COURSE WILL BE COVERED BY EXISTING PROGRAM FACULTY?</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="height: 100px; margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="faculty_coverage_statement">{{ faculty_coverage_statement }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>22. IS THE OLD COURSE PART OF ANY OTHER PROGRAM? IF SO, PLEASE ATTACH EVIDENCE THAT YOU HAVE INFORMED THAT PROGRAM OF YOUR INTENTION TO REPLACE THIS COURSE (E.G. AN EMAIL, ETC.)</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="height: 100px; margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="old_course_program_evidence">{{ old_course_program_evidence }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>23. IS THIS COURSE SIMILAR TO ANY EXISTING COURSES AT UOG? IF SO, WHAT COURSES? IF THERE ARE SIMILAR EXISTING COURSE/S, PLEASE JUSTIFY THE NEED FOR THIS NEW COURSE.</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="height: 100px; margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="similar_existing_courses_justification">{{ similar_existing_courses_justification }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <p>24. ADDITIONAL INFORMATION:</p>
    <div class="full-width-input" style="height: 100px; margin-top: 5px;">
      <span data-field="additional_information">{{ additional_information }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>UOG Station, Mangilao, Guam 96923 Telephone: (671) 735-2994 Fax: (671) 734-3636</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12px;">A Land Grant Institution Accredited by the Western Association of Schools and Colleges</p>
      <p style="font-size: 12px;">The University of Guam is an Equal Employer and Provider.</p>
